---
import Container from '../layout/Container.astro';
import Card from '../ui/Card.astro';

const { email, phone } = Astro.props;
---

<section class="scroll-mt-16 py-16 md:py-20" id="contacto">
  <Container>
    <div class="grid gap-8 rounded-[2rem] border border-phx-8 bg-white p-8 shadow-panel lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1fr)_24rem] lg:p-10">
      <div class="space-y-5">
        <p class="text-sm font-semibold tracking-[0.02em] text-phx-2">Contacto</p>
        <h2 class="max-w-3xl text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-phx-6 md:text-4xl">
          Conversemos sobre una fricción concreta de tu operación
        </h2>
        <p class="max-w-2xl text-base leading-7 text-phx-7 md:text-lg">
          Si hoy existe un flujo manual, una decision lenta o una baja visibilidad que este afectando ejecución,
          podemos revisarlo contigo y aterrizar un punto de partida claro.
        </p>
      </div>

      <Card class="space-y-5 bg-phx-5">
        <div>
          <p class="text-sm font-semibold tracking-[0.02em] text-phx-2">Canales</p>
          <h3 class="mt-3 text-2xl font-semibold text-phx-6">Hablemos</h3>
        </div>
        <div class="space-y-4">
          <a class="block text-base text-phx-7 transition-colors hover:text-phx-2" href={`mailto:${email}`}>
            <span class="block text-sm font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-phx-2">Correo</span>
            <span class="mt-2 block text-lg font-medium text-phx-6">{email}</span>
          </a>
          <a class="block text-base text-phx-7 transition-colors hover:text-phx-2" href={`tel:${phone}`}>
            <span class="block text-sm font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-phx-2">Telefono</span>
            <span class="mt-2 block text-lg font-medium text-phx-6">{phone}</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </Card>
    </div>
  </Container>
</section>
